### Example requests. Run them from IntelliJ IDEA or the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Log in (copy accessToken from the response into @token below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@stockroom.local", "password": "Admin123!"}

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### 2. Search products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=bolt&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Create a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku": "HAMMER-16OZ", "name": "16oz claw hammer", "unitPrice": 189.00, "reorderLevel": 5}

### 4. Receive stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/stock/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 50, "reference": "PO-2041", "note": "Supplier delivery"}

### 5. Create a draft order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerName": "Acme Builders", "lines": [{"productId": 1, "quantity": 10}, {"productId": 2, "quantity": 5}]}

### 6. Confirm it (takes the stock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Stock ledger for a product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/stock/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Low-stock report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
